# The model's remote code (configuration_dots.py, modeling_dots_ocr.py, modeling_dots_vision.py in
# the checkpoint) is used with transformers 4.57.6, the version of the official requirements.txt;
# its processor (DotsVLProcessor) subclasses transformers' Qwen2.5-VL processor. torchvision and
# Pillow are needed by the image and video processors that processor loads. flash-attn, which the
# remote code imports, is not installed: the adapter provides the one function it uses (README.md).
